    "emmc_hint_short": "eMMC is non-volatile storage in portable devices that can use different types of NAND flash memory: SLC, MLC, and TLC. MLC is cheaper than SLC, but has lower endurance. eMMC with MLC has two lifetime ratings: lifetime A and lifetime B. Actual endurance depends on many factors, so manufacturer estimates may vary.",
